WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.384
[Theme music playing]

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

3
00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.901
[Fire crackling]

4
00:01:49.985 --> 00:01:51.361
[Wind blowing]

5
00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:53.322
[Sinister music playing]

6
00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:03.206
[Indistinct shouting]

7
00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:21.183
[Man grunting]

8
00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:23.769
House velaryon is coming for you!

9
00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:27.439
The sea snake will have
your poxy fucking head!

10
00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:30.484
No. no. no. No. please!

11
00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:34.863
[Screaming]

12
00:02:36.073 --> 00:02:37.324
[Groaning]

13
00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.993
Fuck you. prince drahar!

14
00:02:40.077 --> 00:02:43.538
Fuck your whore mother
and bastard father!

15
00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:45.248
[Grunts]

16
00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.627
[Groaning] No. no! No!

17
00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.837
[Groaning]

18
00:02:52.255 --> 00:02:53.256
[Screams]

19
00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:58.804
[Grunting]

20
00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:01.264
[Whistling in distance]

21
00:03:05.477 --> 00:03:07.396
[Indistinct shouting]

22
00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.358
[Roars]

23
00:03:12.818 --> 00:03:14.069
[Man] Dragon!

24
00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:17.364
Hail prince daemon! [Laughs]

25
00:03:18.407 --> 00:03:19.741
[Caraxes whinnies]

26
00:03:19.825 --> 00:03:22.994
Burn the fucking triarchy cunts alive!

27
00:03:24.246 --> 00:03:28.625
[People screaming]

28
00:03:30.711 --> 00:03:32.129
Here. my prince.

29
00:03:33.296 --> 00:03:35.048
Save me!

30
00:03:35.132 --> 00:03:36.133
[Screams]

31
00:03:40.011 --> 00:03:42.514
- [Roars]
- [People screaming]

32
00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.100
[Man 1] To the caves! Now!

33
00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:48.186
[Indistinct shouting]

34
00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.147
[Man 2 screaming]

35
00:03:53.275 --> 00:03:54.985
[Man 3] Retreat to the caves!

36
00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.403
[Indistinct shouting]

37
00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.531
[Caraxes roars]

38
00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:06.288
[Man screaming]

39
00:04:13.628 --> 00:04:15.547
[Caraxes growls]

40
00:04:16.131 --> 00:04:17.799
[Whinnies]

41
00:04:17.883 --> 00:04:19.259
[Prince daemon] Where are you?

42
00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:23.889
Come out and face me. drahar!

43
00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:28.226
- Come out. drahar!
- [Caraxes growls]

44
00:04:28.727 --> 00:04:30.437
[Prince daemon] Where are you?

45
00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.982
I'm gonna feed you to your own crabs!

46
00:04:34.775 --> 00:04:36.276
Where are you?

47
00:04:36.359 --> 00:04:38.487
[Sinister music playing]

48
00:04:44.576 --> 00:04:46.036
[Caraxes whinnies]

49
00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:49.414
[Snarls]

50
00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:54.461
[Shrieking]

51
00:05:12.062 --> 00:05:14.231
[Aegon ii babbling]

52
00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:15.794
[Man 1] He has your hair. your grace.

53
00:05:17.025 --> 00:05:18.527
[Viserys I] He does have my hair.

54
00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.071
- [Man 2] He has your eyes. your grace.
- Yes. he does.

55
00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:23.073
[All laughing]

56
00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:24.634
[Viserys I] And you have my nose.
don't you?

57
00:05:24.658 --> 00:05:28.829
Two years old and already our boy
has a kingly presence.

58
00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:32.165
He may yet. brother.
but this morning he insisted on eating

59
00:05:32.249 --> 00:05:33.959
porridge with his hands.

60
00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.502
[Laughs]

61
00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:36.878
He will grow.

62
00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:41.049
We're quite a party
assembled in his honor.

63
00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:45.470
And surely by the end of this hunt.
we shall have more to celebrate.

64
00:05:45.554 --> 00:05:47.681
And what is that. pray tell.

65
00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:49.933
It is aegon's second name day.

66
00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:51.434
His infancy's behind him.

67
00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:54.563
It only remains for viserys to name him
heir to the throne.

68
00:05:54.646 --> 00:05:56.898
Iwouldn't be so sure.

69
00:05:56.982 --> 00:05:58.483
He's the king's firstborn son.

70
00:05:58.567 --> 00:06:01.444
I don't know that his grace
sees it so clearly.

71
00:06:03.113 --> 00:06:05.740
Then it lies with you
to make him see it...

72
00:06:06.491 --> 00:06:08.326
Lord hand.

73
00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.828
[Tyland] Your grace...

74
00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:13.957
I bring urgent news from the stepstones.

75
00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:16.960
The crabfeeder has dug in
for siege on bloodstone

76
00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:19.504
while his men sabotage our fleet
under the cover of dark.

77
00:06:19.588 --> 00:06:20.964
- Not today. tyland.
- [Shrieks]

78
00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:24.175
The matter of the stepstones
is regrettably urgent.

79
00:06:24.259 --> 00:06:25.969
It's been three years.

80
00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:28.305
- It can wait another three days.
- [Babbling]

81
00:06:32.475 --> 00:06:34.561
[Viserys I] Come. eat.

82
00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:36.897
Fortify yourselves for the journey.

83
00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.190
Please.

84
00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.276
Is the baggage train ready?

85
00:06:41.359 --> 00:06:43.486
It is presently massing
at the river gate.

86
00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.323
Lord Jason expects us
in the kingswood before midday.

87
00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.701
- Have you seen rhaenyra?
- I have not. your grace.

88
00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:55.081
With the triarchy now sheltering
in bloodstone's caves.

89
00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:57.584
the threat of the dragons is blunted.

90
00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:59.711
They don't have foot soldiers.

91
00:06:59.794 --> 00:07:03.173
But their sellswords have been
withdrawing in droves. your grace.

92
00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:06.468
Even the mercenaries can see
that it is a losing effort.

93
00:07:06.551 --> 00:07:07.636
Where's rhaenyra?

94
00:07:08.178 --> 00:07:09.804
I cannot be sure at present. your grace.

95
00:07:09.888 --> 00:07:12.974
The velaryon forces have suffered
heavy attrition. your grace.

96
00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.561
The seeds of dissent are sown
amongst the rank and file.

97
00:07:17.312 --> 00:07:19.356
Daemon has driven the men hard.

98
00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:21.900
They have begun to question his command.

99
00:07:22.901 --> 00:07:25.487
If the crown were ever to intervene...

100
00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.738
- Tyland...
- Now is the time.

101
00:07:26.821 --> 00:07:29.157
Daemon and the sea snake
started their war

102
00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.284
without his grace's leave.

103
00:07:31.368 --> 00:07:34.079
Were he to intervene now after so long.

104
00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:35.997
it would make the crown appear weak.

105
00:07:36.081 --> 00:07:37.582
Can someone tell me

106
00:07:37.666 --> 00:07:40.585
where in the seven hells
rhaenyra might be?

107
00:07:40.669 --> 00:07:45.757
[Singing] Under the dragon's eye

108
00:07:46.883 --> 00:07:52.055
under the dragon's eye

109
00:07:52.597 --> 00:07:53.682
again.

110
00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:54.975
[Birds chirping]

111
00:07:55.058 --> 00:07:57.268
Perhaps the Princess
might like to hear something else?

112
00:07:57.352 --> 00:07:59.187
She would not. Play it again.

113
00:08:03.191 --> 00:08:04.067
[Samwell clears throat]

114
00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.151
[Playing mandolin]

115
00:08:05.235 --> 00:08:08.279
[Singing] She fled with her ships

116
00:08:08.363 --> 00:08:11.199
and her people

117
00:08:11.282 --> 00:08:14.452
her heart broken for those...

118
00:08:15.453 --> 00:08:16.788
Your grace.

119
00:08:16.871 --> 00:08:18.248
Did I say to stop?

120
00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:24.838
[Clicks tongue] From the beginning.

121
00:08:26.006 --> 00:08:27.257
[Samwell clears throat]

122
00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:30.385
[Playing mandolin]

123
00:08:30.468 --> 00:08:33.471
She fled with her ships

124
00:08:33.555 --> 00:08:36.474
- [alicent] Rhaenyra?
- Yes. my queen?

125
00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:39.477
Your presence is wanted
in the outer courtyard.

126
00:08:39.561 --> 00:08:41.730
The royal hunt readies to depart.

127
00:08:41.813 --> 00:08:44.691
I've decided to remain here
and read instead.

128
00:08:45.775 --> 00:08:46.651
[Samwell singing]

129
00:08:46.735 --> 00:08:48.153
You may go. samwell.

130
00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:51.281
You are to stay
by order of the Princess.

131
00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:55.160
The queen commands you
to leave the godswood at once.

132
00:08:57.579 --> 00:08:58.788
Princess.

133
00:09:00.248 --> 00:09:01.248
[Sighs]

134
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.001
[Samwell] Your grace.

135
00:09:06.713 --> 00:09:08.473
[Alicent] The king wishes
for you to join us.

136
00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:11.342
The king has much to celebrate.
He does not need me.

137
00:09:11.426 --> 00:09:13.186
[Alicent] He wants for us all
to be together.

138
00:09:14.054 --> 00:09:17.057
Perhaps the hunt could be... fun.

139
00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:19.976
Is it the king's command?

140
00:09:21.019 --> 00:09:23.229
- Yes. but it...
- Then at once. your grace.

141
00:09:24.147 --> 00:09:25.356
[Alicent] But it needn't be.

142
00:09:26.316 --> 00:09:29.736
None of it needs be this way
in truth. rhaenyra.

143
00:09:32.655 --> 00:09:33.655
[Hooves thudding]

144
00:09:38.536 --> 00:09:40.497
[Viserys I] Well. isn't this splendid?

145
00:09:40.955 --> 00:09:42.957
The whole of our family
off to celebration

146
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:44.959
and adventure in the kingswood.

147
00:09:47.545 --> 00:09:48.963
[Rumbling]

148
00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:51.674
[Aegon ii babbling]

149
00:09:51.758 --> 00:09:53.802
Should you be traveling
in such condition?

150
00:09:53.885 --> 00:09:56.679
The maester said that being out
in nature would do me well.

151
00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.391
Well. you will be with your own child
sooner than late.

152
00:10:00.475 --> 00:10:02.519
and make me a proud grandsire.

153
00:10:04.187 --> 00:10:06.272
It's not so bad.

154
00:10:06.356 --> 00:10:09.776
The days are long. but aegon
came quickly and without fuss.

155
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:19.911
You should ride out with me today.

156
00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:21.955
Join in the chase.

157
00:10:22.831 --> 00:10:24.040
I'd rather not.

158
00:10:24.791 --> 00:10:27.961
The boars squeal like children
when they're being slaughtered.

159
00:10:28.044 --> 00:10:30.338
I find it discomforting.

160
00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:32.090
It's a hunt. rhaenyra.

161
00:10:33.007 --> 00:10:34.007
[Aegon ii yells]

162
00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:37.470
[Viserys I] How would you
like to participate?

163
00:10:37.554 --> 00:10:38.847
I'm not sure why I must.

164
00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.015
Because you are my daughter...

165
00:10:41.099 --> 00:10:42.183
The Princess.

166
00:10:43.226 --> 00:10:44.894
And you have duties.

167
00:10:44.978 --> 00:10:46.980
As I am ceaselessly reminded.

168
00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:49.357
- [Viserys I] I'm sorry?
- As I am ceaselessly reminded.

169
00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:52.652
You wouldn't need to be reminded
if you ever attended to them.

170
00:10:52.735 --> 00:10:54.737
No one's here for me.

171
00:11:01.619 --> 00:11:02.871
[Music playing]

172
00:11:02.954 --> 00:11:05.456
[Indistinct chatter]

173
00:11:16.968 --> 00:11:20.555
[People cheering]

174
00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:59.761
Hail. hail aegon. the conqueror-babe.
second of his name!

175
00:12:00.845 --> 00:12:03.598
Here's to his grace
on his second name day!

176
00:12:12.982 --> 00:12:14.776
[Indistinct chatter]

177
00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:53.064
[Woman] Lady Johanna was reported
to have been abducted

178
00:12:53.147 --> 00:12:56.276
when one of lord Swann's ships
sailed through the stepstones.

179
00:12:56.359 --> 00:12:58.069
What will happen to lady Johanna?

180
00:12:58.152 --> 00:13:00.989
She's to be sold to a pillow house
in the free cities

181
00:13:01.072 --> 00:13:03.074
if you believe the rumors.

182
00:13:04.534 --> 00:13:07.161
I fear the gods did not
make me for hunting.

183
00:13:07.245 --> 00:13:08.663
Might I sit with you. my ladies?

184
00:13:08.746 --> 00:13:10.540
[Alicent] But of course. Pleasejoin us.

185
00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:14.919
Larys strong. the youngest son of our
master of law. lord lyonel.

186
00:13:15.003 --> 00:13:16.546
My lord husband says that no king

187
00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:19.215
has even been able to tame
the stepstones for long.

188
00:13:19.299 --> 00:13:22.343
It's an inhospitable place
suited only for savages.

189
00:13:22.427 --> 00:13:26.055
Perhaps the Princess...
Can give us some insight.

190
00:13:26.848 --> 00:13:30.643
[Chuckles] Oh. I'm not sure how I could.
I've never been to the stepstones.

191
00:13:30.727 --> 00:13:33.730
Your dear uncle is the great mind
behind this war.

192
00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:35.690
- Is he not?
- I wouldn't know.

193
00:13:35.773 --> 00:13:37.191
I've not spoken to daemon in years.

194
00:13:37.275 --> 00:13:39.193
Since you supplanted him as heir.

195
00:13:39.277 --> 00:13:41.446
Daemon made his choices. lady ceira.

196
00:13:42.113 --> 00:13:43.823
The Princess was more suited
to the role.

197
00:13:44.991 --> 00:13:47.994
[Ceira] He's made a mess
and the king must put an end to it.

198
00:13:48.077 --> 00:13:52.248
Send fleets and men
and clear out the triarchy for good.

199
00:13:53.458 --> 00:13:55.084
But the crown is not at war.

200
00:13:55.835 --> 00:13:58.921
The crown... is at war. Princess.

201
00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:00.757
Though your father refuses to admit it.

202
00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.676
we've been dragged into it by your uncle
and the sea snake.

203
00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.305
And how have you served the realm
of late. lady redwyne. by eating cake?

204
00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:14.437
[Music playing]

205
00:14:18.024 --> 00:14:19.567
[Indistinct chatter]

206
00:14:40.421 --> 00:14:42.507
I wonder. Princess...

207
00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.218
Was your own second name day
as grand as this?

208
00:14:45.885 --> 00:14:48.721
I honestly don't recall
and neither will aegon.

209
00:14:51.349 --> 00:14:52.683
Lord Jason Lannister.

210
00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:56.104
I gathered that from all the lions.

211
00:14:56.187 --> 00:14:58.189
I don't think we've been
properly introduced.

212
00:15:01.275 --> 00:15:04.278
Your twin serves on my father's council.

213
00:15:04.779 --> 00:15:07.198
Tyland is...

214
00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:10.493
Frightfully dull. gods love him.

215
00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:12.370
The finest honeyed wine
you'll ever taste.

216
00:15:12.453 --> 00:15:15.081
- Made in lannisport. of course.
- Of course.

217
00:15:16.791 --> 00:15:19.877
The kingswood.
it's fine hunting ground.

218
00:15:19.961 --> 00:15:22.422
But the best spot is to be
found at casterly rock.

219
00:15:22.505 --> 00:15:24.257
near my home.

220
00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.633
Have you been?

221
00:15:25.716 --> 00:15:27.802
Um. once... on tour

222
00:15:27.885 --> 00:15:29.512
with my mother when I was young.

223
00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:32.223
and honestly can't recall
much of that either.

224
00:15:32.306 --> 00:15:35.106
[Lord Jason] The rock is thrice
the height of the hightower in oldtown.

225
00:15:35.184 --> 00:15:37.145
taller still than the wall in the north.

226
00:15:37.228 --> 00:15:38.604
It's been said that

227
00:15:38.688 --> 00:15:42.066
if one were to stand in the tower...
On a perfect day.

228
00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.986
one could see clear
across the sunset sea.

229
00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:47.363
It must be quite something.

230
00:15:47.447 --> 00:15:50.616
Mmm. I don't have a dragonpit.
of course. but...

231
00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:53.327
I do have the means
and resources to build one.

232
00:15:54.454 --> 00:15:56.456
Why would you need a dragonpit?

233
00:15:57.039 --> 00:15:58.875
To house dragons. of course.

234
00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.960
I'd do anything for my queen...

235
00:16:02.003 --> 00:16:04.589
Or... lady wife.

236
00:16:04.672 --> 00:16:06.674
[Music playing]

237
00:16:10.303 --> 00:16:11.554
Thank you for the wine.

238
00:16:13.514 --> 00:16:14.557
[Sighs]

239
00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:20.395
[Sighs]

240
00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.321
[Rhaenyra] Is that what I am to you?

241
00:16:28.404 --> 00:16:31.032
A prize to proffer about
to the great houses?

242
00:16:35.786 --> 00:16:37.788
You're of age. rhaenyra.

243
00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.791
And Jason Lannister
is an excellent match.

244
00:16:40.875 --> 00:16:42.460
He's arrogant and self-serious.

245
00:16:42.543 --> 00:16:44.754
I thought you might have that in common.

246
00:16:45.922 --> 00:16:47.256
Since you came of age.

247
00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.634
I've been slowly drowning
in a lake of parchment

248
00:16:49.717 --> 00:16:51.552
flung from every corner of the realm.

249
00:16:51.636 --> 00:16:53.471
Marriage proposals. all.

250
00:16:53.554 --> 00:16:56.599
And I have tried often
to discuss it with you.

251
00:16:56.682 --> 00:16:58.392
but you've refused me at every turn.

252
00:16:58.476 --> 00:17:00.311
That is because I do not
wish to get married.

253
00:17:00.394 --> 00:17:02.980
Even I do not exist above tradition
and duty. rhaenyra!

254
00:17:03.064 --> 00:17:04.941
Excuse me. your grace.

255
00:17:13.199 --> 00:17:14.492
You must marry.

256
00:17:17.912 --> 00:17:19.330
- Yes?
- The royal huntsman

257
00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:20.665
have sent a report. your grace.

258
00:17:20.748 --> 00:17:23.668
There's been a sighting of a white hart.

259
00:17:25.169 --> 00:17:27.380
The stag is "the king of the kingswood."
your grace.

260
00:17:27.463 --> 00:17:30.383
A regal portent
for prince aegon's name day.

261
00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:36.806
- [Chuckles]
- [Music playing]

262
00:17:38.307 --> 00:17:40.017
[Indistinct chatter]

263
00:17:52.613 --> 00:17:54.031
Princess.

264
00:18:00.621 --> 00:18:02.039
Princess. wait!

265
00:18:21.892 --> 00:18:23.102
Princess. slow down!

266
00:18:29.692 --> 00:18:32.653
[Indistinct shouting]

267
00:18:32.737 --> 00:18:33.821
Princess!

268
00:18:33.904 --> 00:18:35.031
[Whinnies]

269
00:18:39.577 --> 00:18:42.079
[Criston] Whoa. whoa. now!

270
00:18:47.418 --> 00:18:48.461
[Panting]

271
00:18:50.296 --> 00:18:52.298
What happened back there?

272
00:18:53.424 --> 00:18:55.509
My father...

273
00:18:55.593 --> 00:18:58.429
Trying to sell me off
to Jason Lannister.

274
00:19:00.765 --> 00:19:04.560
Was I named heir to the iron throne

275
00:19:04.644 --> 00:19:07.188
so that I might only
further raise the standing

276
00:19:07.271 --> 00:19:09.273
of a lord of casterly rock?

277
00:19:12.735 --> 00:19:14.403
Do you want me to kill him?

278
00:19:16.906 --> 00:19:17.907
[Scoffs]

279
00:19:20.034 --> 00:19:23.120
- [Chuckles]
- We should return to camp. Princess.

280
00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:27.750
It's a beautiful day.

281
00:19:28.626 --> 00:19:30.628
We should take in the kingswood.

282
00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.798
[Birds chirping]

283
00:19:36.258 --> 00:19:38.928
Were you ever betrothed. ser criston?

284
00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:41.681
I had an adventurous youth
when my father

285
00:19:41.764 --> 00:19:44.392
served at blackhaven. to be sure.

286
00:19:44.475 --> 00:19:47.311
But my station was never high enough
for a formal betrothal.

287
00:19:47.895 --> 00:19:50.106
Before I spoke my vows
as a knight of the kingsguard.

288
00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:52.191
I could've married
a common-born girl had I wished.

289
00:19:52.274 --> 00:19:55.569
How lucky you are to have
a say in your own life.

290
00:19:55.653 --> 00:19:58.906
Many in the realm would gladly
trade positions with you. Princess.

291
00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.703
Only because none of them
has ever held my position.

292
00:20:04.745 --> 00:20:07.748
I may be the Princess of dragonstone.
but I am toothless.

293
00:20:10.376 --> 00:20:11.585
One day...

294
00:20:12.503 --> 00:20:14.547
Not so long ago.

295
00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:18.134
you held enough power to write my name
into the white book.

296
00:20:18.217 --> 00:20:20.136
And when your father
named me to his kingsguard.

297
00:20:20.219 --> 00:20:22.638
it was the highest honor
any Cole have ever known.

298
00:20:23.848 --> 00:20:25.850
All that I have. I owe to you.

299
00:20:27.935 --> 00:20:30.938
Now I'd hardly call that
toothless. Princess.

300
00:20:33.357 --> 00:20:34.442
[Dogs barking]

301
00:21:03.345 --> 00:21:05.306
- [Man] Your grace.
- [Viserys I] How far?

302
00:21:05.389 --> 00:21:08.058
Her droppings were found
half a league to the east.

303
00:21:12.605 --> 00:21:13.814
[Sniffs] Still fresh.

304
00:21:13.898 --> 00:21:15.816
Between two and three hours.
your grace.

305
00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.651
My best scouts spied him.

306
00:21:17.735 --> 00:21:19.987
The beast is upward of 35 stone.

307
00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:22.448
And we now have his trail.

308
00:21:22.531 --> 00:21:25.701
- Aye.
- Before the dragons ruled over Westeros.

309
00:21:25.785 --> 00:21:28.454
the white hart was a symbol of royalty
in these lands.

310
00:21:30.039 --> 00:21:31.791
And on this day of all days.

311
00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:35.795
I've never been one
for signs and portents. your grace.

312
00:21:35.878 --> 00:21:39.089
but if the gods did wish
to show their favor...

313
00:21:39.173 --> 00:21:40.173
[Chuckles softly]

314
00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:45.470
[Sighs]

315
00:21:45.513 --> 00:21:47.640
[Dogs barking]

316
00:21:59.902 --> 00:22:00.986
[Sighs]

317
00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:03.948
[Indistinct chatter]

318
00:22:21.215 --> 00:22:22.550
[Lord Jason] Your grace...

319
00:22:25.553 --> 00:22:29.390
I had this forged in the golden gallery
in honor of prince aegon.

320
00:22:41.151 --> 00:22:42.236
It's quite a thing.

321
00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:45.239
I hope it might provide

322
00:22:45.322 --> 00:22:47.408
the killing stroke
against your white hart.

323
00:22:50.286 --> 00:22:52.288
The king of the kingswood.

324
00:22:53.956 --> 00:22:56.959
It's as if the seven themselves
have blessed this day.

325
00:22:57.042 --> 00:23:00.045
Thank you for your generosity.

326
00:23:02.882 --> 00:23:04.508
[Lord Jason] I would be honored

327
00:23:05.634 --> 00:23:08.637
to take the Princess rhaenyra
to wife. your grace.

328
00:23:09.972 --> 00:23:11.557
What I offer you.

329
00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:14.935
the crown and your daughter.
is strength.

330
00:23:17.646 --> 00:23:21.817
Do you think that house Targaryen
wants for strength?

331
00:23:22.276 --> 00:23:25.237
If someone offered you more dragons.
would you not take them?

332
00:23:25.905 --> 00:23:28.532
Do you have dragons to offer?

333
00:23:30.993 --> 00:23:33.370
Casterly rock is a splendid seat.

334
00:23:33.454 --> 00:23:36.665
Rhaenyra may take her place there
by my side. without shame.

335
00:23:36.749 --> 00:23:39.752
and feel herselfwell-compensated
for her loss in station.

336
00:23:40.461 --> 00:23:42.463
What loss of station?

337
00:23:43.297 --> 00:23:46.508
If you were to name
young aegon heir. your grace.

338
00:23:46.592 --> 00:23:48.802
And when would I be doing that?

339
00:23:50.179 --> 00:23:53.974
I had assumed...
As he's your firstborn son...

340
00:23:54.058 --> 00:23:56.977
- Many of us had assumed...
- Many of us. you say?

341
00:23:57.978 --> 00:24:00.564
Have your bannermen
questioned my choice of heir?

342
00:24:00.648 --> 00:24:01.857
Of course not. your grace.

343
00:24:01.941 --> 00:24:04.109
It is your sworn duty
to report rebellion

344
00:24:04.193 --> 00:24:06.362
- stirring in my kingdom.
- [Lord Jason] Rebellion?

345
00:24:06.445 --> 00:24:09.031
There's been nothing
of the sort. your grace.

346
00:24:09.114 --> 00:24:13.160
I did not decide to name
rhaenyra my heir on a whim.

347
00:24:14.411 --> 00:24:18.165
All the lords of the kingdom
would do well to remember that.

348
00:24:20.876 --> 00:24:23.879
Thank you... for the gift.

349
00:24:27.091 --> 00:24:28.300
Your grace.

350
00:24:32.930 --> 00:24:34.014
Wine.

351
00:24:35.474 --> 00:24:36.474
[Sighs]

352
00:24:37.977 --> 00:24:39.103
[Sighs in exasperation]

353
00:24:42.398 --> 00:24:43.399
[Grunts]

354
00:24:44.608 --> 00:24:45.609
[Sighs]

355
00:24:46.986 --> 00:24:50.531
The huntsman has the trail. your grace.
and has sent out the hounds.

356
00:24:50.614 --> 00:24:52.908
It won't be long now
until the white hart is cornered.

357
00:24:52.992 --> 00:24:55.619
Your prize is within reach.

358
00:24:57.663 --> 00:25:00.666
What do you make
of lord Jason's proposal?

359
00:25:01.250 --> 00:25:04.044
- That man's pride has pride.
- [Scoffs]

360
00:25:07.256 --> 00:25:10.676
You're not only rhaenyra's father.
you're the king.

361
00:25:11.552 --> 00:25:13.387
She'll do as you command.

362
00:25:14.638 --> 00:25:18.058
It is not my wish to command her. Otto.

363
00:25:18.142 --> 00:25:20.144
I want her to be happy.

364
00:25:26.025 --> 00:25:29.028
There is another choice
beyond casterly rock.

365
00:25:30.237 --> 00:25:33.490
One. perhaps. you might be more
comfortable with.

366
00:25:33.574 --> 00:25:36.368
One... closer to home.

367
00:25:37.036 --> 00:25:39.163
Who do you have in mind?

368
00:25:42.458 --> 00:25:43.834
Prince aegon.

369
00:25:50.883 --> 00:25:52.092
[Aegon ii cooing]

370
00:25:53.010 --> 00:25:54.720
The boyjust turned two. Otto.

371
00:25:54.803 --> 00:25:56.889
[Otto] Yes. but it would cease

372
00:25:56.972 --> 00:25:59.475
the endless proposals
for rhaenyra's hand.

373
00:25:59.725 --> 00:26:01.226
[Laughing]

374
00:26:01.310 --> 00:26:04.730
- Betroth them.
- I came here to hunt...

375
00:26:04.813 --> 00:26:08.817
Not to be suffocated
by all this fucking politicking.

376
00:26:09.943 --> 00:26:11.945
Let us speak no more of it.

377
00:26:22.122 --> 00:26:24.166
[Indistinct chatter]

378
00:26:28.045 --> 00:26:30.005
[Music playing]

379
00:26:49.024 --> 00:26:50.067
[Sighs]

380
00:27:04.498 --> 00:27:07.793
[Lord strong] We've sent out riders
to find rhaenyra. your grace.

381
00:27:08.293 --> 00:27:11.171
Ser criston went after her.
so the hope is that they are together.

382
00:27:11.255 --> 00:27:13.632
The girl is a heedless contrarian.

383
00:27:14.925 --> 00:27:17.594
If I instead forbade her
to wed a Lannister.

384
00:27:17.678 --> 00:27:20.889
she would've run off
with lord Jason out of spite.

385
00:27:22.391 --> 00:27:25.018
A truly great Targaryen king I am.

386
00:27:26.019 --> 00:27:29.314
Powerless over mine own
daughter of seven-and-ten.

387
00:27:30.149 --> 00:27:32.818
King jaehaerys ruled over
half a century of peace

388
00:27:32.901 --> 00:27:36.363
while his children drove him
to the edge of madness...

389
00:27:36.446 --> 00:27:38.657
His daughters. in particular.

390
00:27:38.740 --> 00:27:41.118
It is tradition. your grace.

391
00:27:41.201 --> 00:27:42.327
[Scoffs]

392
00:27:48.041 --> 00:27:50.586
Do you wish to hear
my opinion on the matter?

393
00:27:51.795 --> 00:27:53.088
[Sighs in exasperation]

394
00:27:55.048 --> 00:27:56.800
Should I guess?

395
00:27:58.927 --> 00:28:00.637
You believe that your son.

396
00:28:00.721 --> 00:28:03.223
ser hannin "breakbones."

397
00:28:03.307 --> 00:28:06.518
the strongest knight
in the seven kingdoms.

398
00:28:06.602 --> 00:28:08.854
is the best match for rhaenyra.

399
00:28:10.647 --> 00:28:12.733
You flatter me. your grace. but no.

400
00:28:13.775 --> 00:28:16.069
It would seem to me
the best match for rhaenyra

401
00:28:16.153 --> 00:28:17.738
is the son of the sea snake.

402
00:28:17.821 --> 00:28:18.989
ser laenor.

403
00:28:20.157 --> 00:28:23.243
Some years ago. I counseled you
to take his sister to wife.

404
00:28:23.327 --> 00:28:25.329
My reasoning remains the same.

405
00:28:26.371 --> 00:28:28.999
Laenor is of pure valyrian descent.

406
00:28:29.833 --> 00:28:32.711
He shares blood with your cousin.
the Princess rhaenys.

407
00:28:33.337 --> 00:28:36.757
And he is the heir to the wealthiest
house in the realm.

408
00:28:37.716 --> 00:28:39.134
The breach between your houses

409
00:28:39.218 --> 00:28:40.886
has not narrowed
since I last spoke of it.

410
00:28:40.969 --> 00:28:43.180
It would do much to assuage lord corlys

411
00:28:43.263 --> 00:28:46.099
of any slights real... or imagined.

412
00:28:51.939 --> 00:28:54.233
We must pray. of course.
that laenor survives

413
00:28:54.316 --> 00:28:55.817
the fighting in the stepstones.

414
00:29:11.959 --> 00:29:13.377
[Music playing]

415
00:29:34.856 --> 00:29:37.859
Princess. I must make a final plea
that we return to the camp.

416
00:29:37.943 --> 00:29:39.152
[Crickets chirping]

417
00:29:39.236 --> 00:29:41.238
I rather prefer it here.

418
00:29:43.156 --> 00:29:46.368
His grace is certain to be worried
by your absence.

419
00:29:46.451 --> 00:29:50.455
His grace can worry
himself to death if he so likes.

420
00:30:00.757 --> 00:30:02.259
Tell me something. ser criston.

421
00:30:04.052 --> 00:30:07.055
Do you think the realm will
ever accept me as their queen?

422
00:30:14.730 --> 00:30:17.357
They'll have no choice but to. Princess.

423
00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:21.820
[Horse whinnies]

424
00:30:33.582 --> 00:30:34.708
[Twigs snapping]

425
00:30:40.714 --> 00:30:43.717
[Braying]

426
00:30:59.941 --> 00:31:03.695
[Breath trembling]

427
00:31:14.706 --> 00:31:16.375
- [Intense music playing]
- [Snarling]

428
00:31:16.833 --> 00:31:18.043
[Grunts]

429
00:31:20.962 --> 00:31:22.756
[Growls]

430
00:31:23.465 --> 00:31:25.675
[Grunting]

431
00:31:25.759 --> 00:31:26.759
[Growling]

432
00:31:30.472 --> 00:31:31.515
[Shrieks]

433
00:31:32.432 --> 00:31:33.850
[Criston grunts]

434
00:31:33.934 --> 00:31:36.228
[Both panting]

435
00:31:41.691 --> 00:31:43.819
- [Snarling]
- [Grunting]

436
00:31:43.902 --> 00:31:45.195
[Boar shrieking]

437
00:31:49.491 --> 00:31:53.078
[Sobbing]

438
00:32:13.390 --> 00:32:15.392
Is everything all right. your grace?

439
00:32:17.853 --> 00:32:19.104
[Sighs]

440
00:32:19.187 --> 00:32:20.564
You know. I...

441
00:32:21.565 --> 00:32:25.777
I named her to protect
the realm from daemon.

442
00:32:28.405 --> 00:32:30.240
She was my only child.

443
00:32:31.741 --> 00:32:33.743
"The realm's delight."

444
00:32:34.661 --> 00:32:36.663
I named her out of love

445
00:32:37.789 --> 00:32:39.958
because I no longer believed...

446
00:32:41.501 --> 00:32:43.128
Believed what. my love?

447
00:32:43.795 --> 00:32:44.921
[Sighs]

448
00:32:51.553 --> 00:32:54.556
Many in my line have been dragonriders.

449
00:32:56.641 --> 00:32:59.019
Very few among us have been dreamers.

450
00:33:03.523 --> 00:33:06.026
What is the power of a dragon...

451
00:33:06.109 --> 00:33:08.069
Next to the power of prophecy?

452
00:33:08.153 --> 00:33:09.613
The hour is too late. husband.

453
00:33:09.696 --> 00:33:11.781
When rhaenyra was a child...

454
00:33:11.865 --> 00:33:12.699
[Somber music playing]

455
00:33:12.782 --> 00:33:14.784
I saw it in a dream...

456
00:33:15.952 --> 00:33:18.371
As vivid as these flames. I saw it.

457
00:33:20.123 --> 00:33:23.710
A male babe born to me...

458
00:33:23.793 --> 00:33:25.795
Wearing the conqueror's crown.

459
00:33:28.131 --> 00:33:30.592
And I so wanted it to be true.

460
00:33:30.675 --> 00:33:32.886
to be a dreamer myself.

461
00:33:35.096 --> 00:33:38.099
I sought that vision again.
night after night...

462
00:33:39.476 --> 00:33:41.478
But it never came again.

463
00:33:43.063 --> 00:33:46.149
I poured all my thought
and will into it.

464
00:33:48.652 --> 00:33:51.279
And my obsession
killed rhaenyra's mother.

465
00:33:51.363 --> 00:33:52.822
[Alicent] Viserys.

466
00:33:53.865 --> 00:33:58.870
[Viserys I] I thought rhaenyra was the
way out of my abyss of grief and regret.

467
00:34:00.830 --> 00:34:03.291
And naming her heir
would begin to set things right.

468
00:34:03.375 --> 00:34:06.378
- Oh. it did.
- I never imagined I would remarry...

469
00:34:07.295 --> 00:34:08.922
That I would have a son.

470
00:34:13.927 --> 00:34:15.929
What if I was wrong?

471
00:34:21.935 --> 00:34:26.523
[Horn blows]

472
00:34:37.117 --> 00:34:38.535
[Splashes]

473
00:34:43.331 --> 00:34:45.333
- [Birds chirping]
- [Dogs barking]

474
00:35:15.655 --> 00:35:17.616
- [Man 1 grunts]
- [Hart groaning]

475
00:35:17.699 --> 00:35:18.908
[Man 2] Left.

476
00:35:19.701 --> 00:35:22.329
[Groaning]

477
00:35:23.121 --> 00:35:25.373
[Men grunting]

478
00:35:25.457 --> 00:35:27.208
[Somber music playing]

479
00:35:27.292 --> 00:35:29.544
He may not be white. your grace.

480
00:35:29.628 --> 00:35:30.754
But he's a big lad.

481
00:35:31.379 --> 00:35:32.839
[Dogs barking]

482
00:35:34.132 --> 00:35:35.800
[Horse whinnies]

483
00:35:37.761 --> 00:35:41.139
Your grace... for the kill.

484
00:35:52.942 --> 00:35:55.987
[Hart groaning]

485
00:35:56.071 --> 00:35:57.572
[Dog barking]

486
00:35:57.656 --> 00:36:00.116
[Huffing]

487
00:36:00.200 --> 00:36:01.409
[Groaning]

488
00:36:06.790 --> 00:36:08.416
Right here. your grace.

489
00:36:10.168 --> 00:36:11.670
[Hart groaning]

490
00:36:15.090 --> 00:36:16.216
[Grunts]

491
00:36:18.051 --> 00:36:19.051
[Yells]

492
00:36:19.094 --> 00:36:21.513
[Hart wailing]

493
00:36:33.191 --> 00:36:35.193
[Barking]

494
00:36:35.276 --> 00:36:36.861
[Hart wailing]

495
00:36:38.822 --> 00:36:41.825
One more time. your grace.
A little bit to your left.

496
00:36:43.785 --> 00:36:45.203
[Hart groaning]

497
00:36:53.586 --> 00:36:55.630
- [Yells]
- [Hart wails]

498
00:36:56.631 --> 00:37:02.011
[Wailing]

499
00:37:02.095 --> 00:37:05.014
[Breathing heavily]

500
00:37:08.727 --> 00:37:09.728
[Grunts]

501
00:37:16.901 --> 00:37:19.404
[All applauding]

502
00:37:25.660 --> 00:37:27.912
[Wind blowing]

503
00:37:42.135 --> 00:37:44.137
[Hart huffing]

504
00:38:02.447 --> 00:38:04.115
[Groans]

505
00:38:06.576 --> 00:38:08.453
[Music playing]

506
00:38:08.536 --> 00:38:09.579
[Brays]

507
00:38:13.291 --> 00:38:14.709
[Whispers] No.

508
00:38:14.793 --> 00:38:17.796
[Hart huffing]

509
00:38:35.104 --> 00:38:38.274
[Music playing]

510
00:38:38.358 --> 00:38:40.193
[Indistinct chatter]

511
00:39:33.580 --> 00:39:37.584
[Baby crying]

512
00:39:37.667 --> 00:39:38.960
Come. sweet prince.

513
00:39:39.043 --> 00:39:41.212
Let's give her grace some peace.

514
00:39:56.144 --> 00:39:57.979
Did you enjoy the hunt. your grace?

515
00:39:59.147 --> 00:40:02.609
- Well enough.
- How fared my grandson?

516
00:40:03.735 --> 00:40:06.321
The ladies Lannister and redwyne
were quite taken with him.

517
00:40:06.404 --> 00:40:08.406
[Otto] As they should be.

518
00:40:09.324 --> 00:40:11.326
He's the future of the realm.

519
00:40:12.911 --> 00:40:15.914
You yourself witnessed
the scale of the celebration.

520
00:40:15.997 --> 00:40:18.249
how it's united the men.

521
00:40:18.333 --> 00:40:19.751
When you bore the king a son.

522
00:40:19.834 --> 00:40:23.046
you ended 15 years
of uncertainty and doubt.

523
00:40:24.047 --> 00:40:25.465
Aegon. like his namesake.

524
00:40:25.548 --> 00:40:27.967
was born to rule the seven kingdoms.

525
00:40:28.885 --> 00:40:32.889
If viserys were to name him heir.
the realm would fete him for it.

526
00:40:38.478 --> 00:40:40.104
And does this not please you?

527
00:40:40.563 --> 00:40:44.192
- Do you not want your son to be king?
- And what mother wouldn't?

528
00:40:45.318 --> 00:40:47.278
[Otto] You mustn't ignore
the certain truth

529
00:40:47.362 --> 00:40:50.490
that if rhaenyra were to step over aegon
to ascend the throne.

530
00:40:50.573 --> 00:40:52.909
the realm would tear itself apart.

531
00:40:54.869 --> 00:40:58.081
They all swore obeisance to her.
our house among them.

532
00:40:58.164 --> 00:41:00.166
[Otto] That was before aegon.

533
00:41:01.501 --> 00:41:02.919
Rhaenyra will be a good queen.

534
00:41:03.002 --> 00:41:07.423
It wouldn't matter if she were
jaehaerys himself born again.

535
00:41:09.384 --> 00:41:12.303
- Rhaenyra is a woman.
- [Alicent] What of my son?

536
00:41:12.387 --> 00:41:15.306
Would you have me raise a man
to steal his own sister's birthright?

537
00:41:15.390 --> 00:41:18.309
[Otto] It is aegon that's being robbed.

538
00:41:18.393 --> 00:41:20.353
He's the firstborn son of the king.

539
00:41:20.436 --> 00:41:22.522
To deny that he is heir to the throne

540
00:41:22.605 --> 00:41:24.983
is to assail the laws of gods and men.

541
00:41:27.193 --> 00:41:31.155
The road ahead is uncertain.
but the end is clear.

542
00:41:31.239 --> 00:41:33.241
Aegon will be king.

543
00:41:34.993 --> 00:41:37.620
You must guide viserys towards reason.

544
00:41:40.415 --> 00:41:42.417
He'll never find it on his own.

545
00:41:42.500 --> 00:41:44.210
[Viserys I breathing heavily]

546
00:41:50.341 --> 00:41:51.926
[Alicent] How are you feeling. husband?

547
00:41:52.010 --> 00:41:54.971
The gods have punished me
for my indulgences.

548
00:41:55.054 --> 00:41:57.223
- [Door closes]
- At least the wine was good.

549
00:41:57.306 --> 00:41:58.866
- [Sighs] Too good.
- [Alicent chuckles]

550
00:42:01.811 --> 00:42:03.021
[Viserys I sighs]

551
00:42:10.945 --> 00:42:13.031
I was hoping we might discuss something.

552
00:42:14.198 --> 00:42:15.198
[Sighs]

553
00:42:16.159 --> 00:42:17.368
Rhaenyra?

554
00:42:19.620 --> 00:42:20.620
[Sighs]

555
00:42:21.456 --> 00:42:23.875
I do not think she enjoyed
Jason Lannister's company.

556
00:42:25.209 --> 00:42:27.420
She is cross.

557
00:42:27.503 --> 00:42:29.380
I warned you that she would be.

558
00:42:29.464 --> 00:42:31.424
Rhaenyra has come of age.

559
00:42:31.507 --> 00:42:34.343
She must needs marry a high lord
who will honor her. defend her.

560
00:42:34.427 --> 00:42:36.179
and serve her as king consort.

561
00:42:36.888 --> 00:42:39.682
Her wishes in this matter
are irrelevant.

562
00:42:39.766 --> 00:42:42.769
I do believe that rhaenyra
will marry. your grace.

563
00:42:43.519 --> 00:42:46.564
But she must believe
it is her choice to do so.

564
00:42:52.904 --> 00:42:54.113
[Grunts]

565
00:42:55.239 --> 00:42:57.658
- What's this?
- [Viserys I] A letter...

566
00:42:57.742 --> 00:42:59.035
[Fihuds]

567
00:42:59.702 --> 00:43:01.704
From vaemond velaryon.

568
00:43:02.163 --> 00:43:04.791
- [Alicent] The sea snake's brother?
- Yeah.

569
00:43:05.625 --> 00:43:08.044
He's fighting in the stepstones.

570
00:43:08.127 --> 00:43:09.754
with all the rest of them.

571
00:43:15.051 --> 00:43:16.135
May I?

572
00:43:27.188 --> 00:43:29.816
Lord corlys and prince daemon
are losing their war.

573
00:43:30.441 --> 00:43:32.652
Badly. by all accounts.

574
00:43:33.402 --> 00:43:35.279
This is a plea for aid.

575
00:43:37.824 --> 00:43:39.826
Then why not send it?

576
00:43:39.909 --> 00:43:42.995
[Viserys I] Because it is a war
started by two malcontents.

577
00:43:43.079 --> 00:43:45.289
unhappy with decisions I made.

578
00:43:46.749 --> 00:43:49.919
If I now provide
daemon and corlys succor.

579
00:43:50.002 --> 00:43:51.462
what will that say of their king?

580
00:43:51.546 --> 00:43:54.257
Perhaps. that he is a good man who
loves his brother.

581
00:43:54.340 --> 00:43:57.635
Well. if you truly
believe that. my dear...

582
00:43:57.718 --> 00:43:59.929
Then you possess a generous spirit.

583
00:44:01.430 --> 00:44:03.766
What do you believe. viserys?

584
00:44:07.103 --> 00:44:09.272
That I am forever doomed
to anger one person

585
00:44:09.355 --> 00:44:10.982
in the pleasing of another.

586
00:44:11.691 --> 00:44:13.693
[Alicent] Then I pose
a simpler question.

587
00:44:14.777 --> 00:44:17.822
Is it better for the realm
if the crabfeeder thrives.

588
00:44:17.905 --> 00:44:19.532
or is vanquished?

589
00:44:22.994 --> 00:44:24.203
[Door opens]

590
00:44:26.289 --> 00:44:28.291
[Viserys I] Make haste to dwarfstone.
seraddam.

591
00:44:28.374 --> 00:44:30.710
Hand-deliver this
to prince daemon yourself.

592
00:44:30.793 --> 00:44:32.378
At once. your grace.

593
00:44:40.887 --> 00:44:44.307
- Dwarfstone?
- I'm sending word to daemon.

594
00:44:44.390 --> 00:44:46.809
Aid is sailing to the stepstones.

595
00:44:46.893 --> 00:44:47.727
[Door closes]

596
00:44:47.810 --> 00:44:51.647
- Did he make call for help?
- He would sooner die.

597
00:44:51.731 --> 00:44:53.941
But his king does not mean
to allow that.

598
00:44:58.571 --> 00:45:00.781
Do you not think my decision correct?

599
00:45:00.865 --> 00:45:03.367
It is no consequence to what I think...

600
00:45:03.451 --> 00:45:05.328
As I'm often reminded.

601
00:45:05.411 --> 00:45:06.412
[Sighs]

602
00:45:06.495 --> 00:45:07.747
[Chuckles]

603
00:45:07.830 --> 00:45:10.458
Daemon is Thorn enough in my flesh.

604
00:45:11.209 --> 00:45:13.085
Will you insist on taking after him?

605
00:45:14.503 --> 00:45:16.172
Must everything be a battle?

606
00:45:16.255 --> 00:45:19.550
If you refer to your attempt
to marry me off to casterly rock...

607
00:45:21.177 --> 00:45:22.595
I am sorry. rhaenyra.

608
00:45:23.804 --> 00:45:27.350
I was trying to help you.
Will you not be helped?

609
00:45:28.559 --> 00:45:31.938
Why must every effort
on your behalf be resisted

610
00:45:32.021 --> 00:45:34.941
- as if to the death?
- Because you mean to replace me...

611
00:45:35.858 --> 00:45:38.152
With alicent hightower's son.

612
00:45:38.236 --> 00:45:40.696
the boy you always wanted.

613
00:45:41.447 --> 00:45:42.990
You have him in hands now.

614
00:45:43.074 --> 00:45:45.618
You have no further use for me.

615
00:45:45.701 --> 00:45:47.995
You might as well peddle me
for what you can.

616
00:45:48.079 --> 00:45:51.624
A mountain stronghold
or a fleet of ships.

617
00:45:51.707 --> 00:45:53.751
You have misjudged me. rhaenyra.

618
00:45:53.834 --> 00:45:55.628
All know it.

619
00:45:55.711 --> 00:45:57.797
Jason Lannister knows it.

620
00:45:57.880 --> 00:45:59.382
You said it yourself.

621
00:45:59.465 --> 00:46:02.301
the lords of the realm
gather like vultures to a carcass.

622
00:46:02.385 --> 00:46:04.387
hoping to feast on my bones.

623
00:46:06.931 --> 00:46:11.060
It is true that as rulers
we must marry for advantage

624
00:46:11.143 --> 00:46:14.230
to forge alliances
and bolster our strength.

625
00:46:14.313 --> 00:46:16.774
You have always understood this.

626
00:46:17.441 --> 00:46:19.860
I myselfwas promised
to your mother when I was...

627
00:46:19.944 --> 00:46:21.862
Ten-and-seven years of age.

628
00:46:21.946 --> 00:46:23.781
The vale had an army to rival the north.

629
00:46:23.864 --> 00:46:26.409
I've heard that story
since I've had ears to.

630
00:46:27.618 --> 00:46:29.620
I loved her.

631
00:46:30.246 --> 00:46:31.664
She made a man of me.

632
00:46:35.251 --> 00:46:37.628
I do not seek to replace you. child.

633
00:46:39.255 --> 00:46:41.507
You've been much alone
these last few years.

634
00:46:41.590 --> 00:46:43.592
Alone and angry.

635
00:46:45.094 --> 00:46:46.804
I will not live forever.

636
00:46:46.887 --> 00:46:48.889
I wish to see you contented.

637
00:46:48.973 --> 00:46:50.474
happy even.

638
00:46:50.558 --> 00:46:51.851
You think a man will do it?

639
00:46:51.934 --> 00:46:53.936
- A family.
- I had a family.

640
00:46:54.020 --> 00:46:55.563
What would you have me do?

641
00:46:55.646 --> 00:46:58.649
If it was for advantage.
you would've wed laena velaryon!

642
00:47:03.571 --> 00:47:05.197
That is true enough.

643
00:47:07.867 --> 00:47:09.994
You must marry.

644
00:47:10.703 --> 00:47:13.331
strengthen your own claim.

645
00:47:13.414 --> 00:47:15.624
shore up your succession.

646
00:47:15.708 --> 00:47:17.126
multiply.

647
00:47:18.544 --> 00:47:20.254
As to your match...

648
00:47:21.964 --> 00:47:23.341
Make it yourself.

649
00:47:24.425 --> 00:47:26.177
Search him out.

650
00:47:26.260 --> 00:47:29.847
Find one that pleases you. as I did.

651
00:47:45.404 --> 00:47:46.614
Rhaenyra...

652
00:47:52.620 --> 00:47:55.373
I did waver at one time.

653
00:47:57.083 --> 00:48:00.503
But I swear to you now.
on your mother's memory.

654
00:48:01.587 --> 00:48:03.089
you will not be supplanted.

655
00:48:12.556 --> 00:48:13.641
[Door opens]

656
00:48:17.186 --> 00:48:19.397
[Ominous music playing]

657
00:48:29.407 --> 00:48:31.450
[Dragon growls]

658
00:48:47.133 --> 00:48:50.386
[Corlys] We have 16. perhaps 18.
seaworthy ships.

659
00:48:50.469 --> 00:48:52.721
Seven hundred foot. some 60 knights.

660
00:48:52.805 --> 00:48:56.559
Our food quickly dwindles.
save for what we can fish from the sea.

661
00:48:56.642 --> 00:48:57.977
I would say we have a fortnight.

662
00:48:58.060 --> 00:49:00.771
mayhaps a bit longer
with strict rationing.

663
00:49:00.855 --> 00:49:02.857
I've made call for driftmark
to send more ships.

664
00:49:02.940 --> 00:49:05.526
but they will be weeks away.

665
00:49:05.609 --> 00:49:08.112
We are faltering
and the triarchy knows it.

666
00:49:08.195 --> 00:49:11.782
We must press the attack.
continue sending the dragons.

667
00:49:11.866 --> 00:49:13.159
[Laenor] It's pointless. father.

668
00:49:14.201 --> 00:49:16.996
The crabfeeder has
created a chokepoint here.

669
00:49:17.079 --> 00:49:18.747
beyond these dunes.

670
00:49:19.248 --> 00:49:20.624
Archers hold the high positions.

671
00:49:20.708 --> 00:49:22.376
foot soldiers hold the ground.

672
00:49:22.460 --> 00:49:24.628
We've strafed them on
dragonback again and again.

673
00:49:24.712 --> 00:49:27.006
but they just retreat within the caves.

674
00:49:27.089 --> 00:49:30.843
Dragons can circle bloodstone
until they fall out of the sky.

675
00:49:30.926 --> 00:49:33.971
The crabfeeder and his men
have no reason to leave those caves.

676
00:49:34.430 --> 00:49:35.890
[Laenor] We must give them one.

677
00:49:35.973 --> 00:49:38.851
an offering of flesh to bait the crab.

678
00:49:38.934 --> 00:49:40.519
Who?

679
00:49:40.603 --> 00:49:42.438
[Man] Dragon returning!

680
00:49:42.521 --> 00:49:43.814
[Whinnying]

681
00:49:49.695 --> 00:49:51.197
[Vaemond] Yes. Who?

682
00:49:51.280 --> 00:49:53.699
Which man here
will happily go to his death?

683
00:49:53.782 --> 00:49:55.844
Show me the knight
who will march into that hell pit.

684
00:49:55.868 --> 00:49:57.578
nephew. and I will show you a madman.

685
00:49:57.661 --> 00:50:00.498
- Daemon.
- Daemon is why we are losing!

686
00:50:00.581 --> 00:50:03.000
[Laenor] He at least
is fighting this war.

687
00:50:03.083 --> 00:50:05.753
What role have you played
in his council. uncle.

688
00:50:05.836 --> 00:50:07.647
- other than master of complaints?
- Enough. laenon

689
00:50:07.671 --> 00:50:10.674
[vaemond] If king's landing
will not support daemon.

690
00:50:10.758 --> 00:50:12.426
why should any of us?

691
00:50:18.641 --> 00:50:22.645
Blood or no. vaemond.
I will not have you stoke mutiny.

692
00:50:44.208 --> 00:50:46.627
If you do not seize control
of this war. my lord.

693
00:50:46.710 --> 00:50:49.129
the crabs will soon dine on all of us.

694
00:51:05.563 --> 00:51:06.939
Prince daemon.

695
00:51:07.022 --> 00:51:09.817
I bring word from his grace.
viserys Targaryen.

696
00:51:09.900 --> 00:51:11.652
first of his name. king of the andals.

697
00:51:11.735 --> 00:51:13.612
the rhoynar. and the first men.

698
00:51:13.696 --> 00:51:16.699
lord of the seven kingdoms.
and protector of the realm.

699
00:51:34.633 --> 00:51:36.260
[Somber music playing]

700
00:51:53.152 --> 00:51:54.903
[Muffled grunting]

701
00:51:59.491 --> 00:52:03.078
That's enough! Stop!

702
00:52:04.413 --> 00:52:05.831
[Indistinct shouting]

703
00:52:18.302 --> 00:52:19.428
[Viserys I] Brother...

704
00:52:20.346 --> 00:52:24.808
I have ordered 10 ships and 2.000 men
to set sail from king's landing

705
00:52:24.892 --> 00:52:27.311
to join the effort in the stepstones.

706
00:52:28.729 --> 00:52:32.191
Though time and circumstance
have seen us estranged.

707
00:52:32.274 --> 00:52:36.904
know that it is not my desire to see you
fail in your cause.

708
00:52:36.987 --> 00:52:39.448
It is instead my hope
that this aid will deliver

709
00:52:39.531 --> 00:52:42.326
the victory that has thus far evaded us.

710
00:52:44.578 --> 00:52:48.207
I shall pray nightly to
the gods for your safe return.

711
00:53:02.721 --> 00:53:07.476
[Music continues]

712
00:54:41.737 --> 00:54:42.946
Nock.

713
00:55:07.387 --> 00:55:08.639
Draw.

714
00:55:36.750 --> 00:55:39.044
- [Intense music playing]
- [Man 1 screams]

715
00:55:39.127 --> 00:55:41.338
- [Yells]
- [All grunting]

716
00:55:44.675 --> 00:55:46.009
[Grunts]

717
00:55:48.512 --> 00:55:49.513
Loose!

718
00:55:52.182 --> 00:55:56.228
[Panting]

719
00:55:58.021 --> 00:55:59.231
[Man 2] Loose!

720
00:56:02.192 --> 00:56:04.486
- [Yells]
- [Grunts]

721
00:56:05.195 --> 00:56:07.114
- [Yells]
- [Grunting]

722
00:56:14.913 --> 00:56:15.914
[Man 2] Loose!

723
00:56:34.725 --> 00:56:36.143
Loose!

724
00:56:37.644 --> 00:56:38.729
[Man 3 yells]

725
00:56:38.812 --> 00:56:40.647
[Grunts]

726
00:56:40.731 --> 00:56:42.441
[Yells]

727
00:56:42.524 --> 00:56:44.067
[Groans]

728
00:56:44.151 --> 00:56:45.319
[Yelling]

729
00:56:45.402 --> 00:56:47.905
[Grunting]

730
00:56:55.078 --> 00:56:57.205
[Men yelling]

731
00:57:01.877 --> 00:57:04.963
[Both grunting]

732
00:57:12.888 --> 00:57:14.681
[Grunts]

733
00:57:26.860 --> 00:57:28.111
[Muffled scream]

734
00:57:31.907 --> 00:57:33.784
[Sinister music playing]

735
00:57:47.881 --> 00:57:50.092
[Men yelling]

736
00:58:42.519 --> 00:58:44.021
[Music playing]

737
00:58:51.028 --> 00:58:53.864
[Men yelling]

738
00:59:03.665 --> 00:59:06.585
[Men screaming]

739
00:59:17.596 --> 00:59:19.097
[In valyrian] Dracarys!

740
00:59:19.556 --> 00:59:22.309
[Men screaming]

741
00:59:25.395 --> 00:59:27.481
[Men yelling]

742
00:59:32.611 --> 00:59:34.404
- [In English] Nock!
- [Dragon snarls]

743
00:59:35.072 --> 00:59:36.698
Dragon!

744
00:59:39.242 --> 00:59:42.287
[Men screaming]

745
00:59:42.370 --> 00:59:44.247
[Men yelling]

746
01:00:02.849 --> 01:00:05.102
[All grunting]

747
01:00:18.573 --> 01:00:19.491
[Screams]

748
01:00:19.574 --> 01:00:22.619
[All grunting]

749
01:00:34.714 --> 01:00:36.258
[Dragon growls]

750
01:00:37.968 --> 01:00:40.011
- Whoo!
- [Dragon roars]

751
01:00:40.095 --> 01:00:42.514
[All grunting]

752
01:00:54.234 --> 01:00:56.236
[Roars]

753
01:00:56.820 --> 01:00:57.988
[In valyrian] Dracarys!

754
01:00:59.573 --> 01:01:02.117
[Music playing]

755
01:01:16.756 --> 01:01:18.341
[Men yelling]

756
01:01:27.726 --> 01:01:28.977
[Bell chimes]

757
01:01:36.193 --> 01:01:37.903
[Roars]

758
01:01:58.256 --> 01:02:00.967
[Music playing]

758
